## 3. Reinforcement Learning (Mitigation & Control)

| Model | Concept | Pros | Cons | How It Helps the Detection Idea |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **DQL / DQN (Deep Q-Learning)** | Combines Reinforcement Learning with Deep Neural Networks to learn optimal control actions through rewards and penalties. | Enables truly autonomous, zero-human dynamic mitigation and learns complex defense strategies directly from environment feedback. | Highly unstable training phase; requires long exploration time and faces delayed reward challenges. | **Autonomous Mitigation:** Acts as the AI Agent's decision-making brain to learn the best dynamic response based on real-time feedback. |
